    {
      "opcode": "openLensCalibrationAppForCamera",
      "blockType": "COMMAND",
      "text": "open lens calibration app for device [DEVICE_ID] at [WIDTH] x [HEIGHT] [FPS] fps",
      "description": "Opens the lens calibration app for one of several cameras: it starts that device at that size, so the profile it saves fits the camera this app runs. An empty device ID opens it without a camera, like open lens calibration app. Reports busy when the window is already open for another camera, and leaves that window alone.",
